**Root cause of the compile-gate failure (attempt 1):** not a Lean source problem. The worktree-root workspace (`lakefile.toml`) routes its build directory through the symlink `.lake -> release/.lake`, but `release/.lake` (the prebuilt mathlib/release oleans that `lake env lean` puts on `LEAN_PATH`) was absent. Every one of the 68 `.lean` files therefore failed in ~0.05 s before Lean ever ran:

